    researchSummaryEn: 'Korzybski (1933, Science and Sanity) and Box (1976, Journal of the American Statistical Association: "All models are wrong, but some are useful") demonstrated the fundamental limits of formal abstraction.',
    refAuthor: 'Korzybski, A. & Box, G. E. P.',
